          "range": [
            528,
            531
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " While this may seem not very useful, it allows `Exclusive` to _unconditionally_",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            532,
            615
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " implement `Sync`. Indeed, the safety requirements of `Sync` state that for `Exclusive`",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            616,
            706
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " to be `Sync`, it must be sound to _share_ across threads, that is, it must be sound",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            707,
            794
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " for `&Exclusive` to cross thread boundaries. By design, a `&Exclusive<T>` for non-`Sync` T",
